            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.22.26+EXO.22.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yaa 22.26-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ka ce imio awotti moro okoporo banya baŋi, mom ibino wot donyo i ode omo gin ame en ojeŋo baŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yin myero iwot icuŋ i oko, eka ŋat ame yin imio okoporo banya-nono en ame te kelo gin ejeŋo baŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok ka ce dano-nono acan, gin ame en ojeŋo myero kur but baŋi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ceŋ doŋ ceggi poto oko, myero kur idwok gin ame en ojeŋo oko baŋe me en but iye, eka te lammi winyo. Ka ce itimo kittono, Rwot Obaŋani bino neni acalo dano a kite atira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
